Delay 15 ms
KeyUp 74 1
Delay 14 ms
KeyUp 22 1
Delay 528 ms
KeyDown 27 1
Delay 79 ms
KeyUp 27 1
Delay 1480 ms
KeyDown 27 1
Delay 72 ms
KeyUp 27 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tekken 8</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
